---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Sill Tactile"
  description="Sill Tactile connects directly to your Mac with zero accounts, zero servers, and zero tracking."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <main class="wrap privacy">
    <p><a href="/">&larr; Back to Sill Tactile</a></p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Sill Tactile (<code>com.uxheavy.sill</code>) is an open-source fork of <a href="https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill">Noah Saffer’s Sill</a>.</p>
    <p>The app connects directly from your iPhone or iPad to your own Mac over your local network, USB cable, or your own VPN. It has no accounts, no ads, no third-party analytics, no telemetry, and no developer servers. Pairing keys and saved Mac records stay exclusively on your device in the iOS Keychain.</p>
    <p>For questions or feedback, open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/nqh-packages/sill">github.com/nqh-packages/sill</a> or email <a href="mailto:rmdngo@gmail.com">rmdngo@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy { max-width: 680px; padding: 48px 22px; }
  .privacy p { color: var(--ink-2); }
</style>
